{"name":"Glint: Always-on-Top Clock for Mac That Makes You Feel Time Pass","short_name":"Glint","description":"Glint is a free, open-source macOS clock for people who lose track of time. It floats above every window and full-screen app, ticks like a real clock, and flashes when a minute or hour changes, with interval nudges, focus blocks and a visual time-depletion dial.","start_url":"/glint/","display":"standalone","background_color":"#0e0f1d","theme_color":"#0e0f1d","icons":[{"src":"/glint/glint-icon.png","sizes":"1024x1024","type":"image/png"}]}